          "summary": "JEDDAH: Some 37 Italian companies were in Jeddah for The Saudifood Show 2026, building on agri-food exports to Saudi Arabia that approached SR2.2 billion ($587 million) in the first 11 months of 2025. Seventeen companies exhibited food and beverage products at the show at the Jeddah Superdome, while 20 participated in Saudifood Manufacturing 2026, showcasing food-processing and packaging technologies. The dual presence reflects Saudi Arabia’s efforts to expand its food manufacturing sector under",
